= Internal Factions of the KPD

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Thalmannites follow Ernst Thalmann, and serve as Stalin's men in the KPD. They seek to enforce strict centralism, build towards the overthrow of boureguoise democracy, and promote the social fascism theory, framing the SPD and NSDAP as equal enemies.">Thalmannites</span>!} strength: [+ thalmannites_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ thalmannites_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Conciliators seek to return the KPD to the United Front strategy, and retain some autonomy from Stalin, calling for a gradual transition to a soviet-style planned economy.">Conciliators</span>!} strength: [+ conciliators_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ conciliators_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Labor Wing's goal is benefits for workers, a popular front against the NSDAP, and direct worker and union ownership over the economy.">Labor_Wing</span>!} strength: [+ labor_wing_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ labor_wing_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Ultras are the most militant within the KPD, and seek to violently oppose the NSDAP at every opportunity.">Ultras</span>!} strength: [+ ultras_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ ultras_dissent : dissent +]


@paramilitaries
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.rfb_strength) {
    Q.rfb_strength_2 = Q.rfb_strength.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.rb_strength) {
    Q.rb_strength_2 = Q.rb_strength.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.sh_strength) {
    Q.sh_strength_2 = Q.sh_strength.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.sa_strength) {
    Q.sa_strength_2 = Q.sa_strength.toFixed(1);
}
!}

= Paramilitaries

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The RFB (Rotfrontkämpferbund) is a communist organization of the KPD, protecting rallies and taking the fight to the fascists in the streets.">RFB</span>!} Strength: [+ rfb_strength_2 +] thousand

RFB Militarization: [+ rfb_militancy : militancy +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Reichsbanner Schwarz-Rot-Gold is a popular organization for defending democracy, mostly affiliated with the SPD.">Reichsbanner</span>!} Strength: [+ rb_strength_2 +] thousand

Reichsbanner Militarization: [+ rb_militancy : militancy +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Stahlhelm is a right-wing organization of war veterans associated with the DNVP.">Stahlhelm</span>!} Strength: [+ sh_strength_2 +] thousand

Stahlhelm Militarization: [+ sh_militancy : militancy +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The SA (Sturmabteilung) is the Nazi paramilitary.">SA</span>!} Strength: [+ sa_strength_2 +] thousand

SA Militarization: [+ sa_militancy : militancy +]

